Local integration for usb-signaller v0.4.2.
Upstream: https://codeberg.org/DylanVanAssche/usb-signaller/src/tag/v0.4.2

Scope mode changes to the configured controller and owned gadgets, provide stable
USB identities, restrict advertised modes to installed backends, serialize mode
changes, and report failures. Nix store executable paths are substituted separately.

